I'm glad to announce the release of PetitTrack 1.2.0. PetitTrack is a
small satellite tracker for the Sharp Zaurus SL-5x00 Linux PDAs. This
release has some new features and several bug fixes. Full details are
available at

http://www.qsl.net/n1vtn

Feedback and bug reports are welcome.

